[Widescreen 16:9]
gsaspectratio=16:9
author=CRASHARKI
description=Run the game at 16:9 Widescreen Aspect Ratio from the start.
patch=1,EE,2030AAC4,word,00000001

[Widescreen 21:9 Ultrawide]
author=CRASHARKI + TechieSaru
description=Forces the built-in widescreen on (CRASHARKI) and widens it from 16:9 to 21:9 (TechieSaru 21:9 Widescreen Fix). Set Graphics > Aspect Ratio to Stretch and play fullscreen on a 21:9 display. Do not combine with Widescreen 16:9.
patch=1,EE,2030AAC4,word,00000001
