[Cutscene Skip (Triangle)]
author=CrashModded
description=Restores the cut cutscene-skip feature: hold Triangle during a skippable cutscene. Re-implements script condition 572 (CutsceneSkipped), which the retail game stubbed to always return 0. Condition 571 is pointed at the identical stub for 570 to free the space.
